                <pb facs="0386" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg298"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and the King of Ethiopia to regulate the
                    commercial relations between the two countries</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Addis-Ababa, December 27,
                        1903.<lb/>Ratification advised by the Senate, March 12, 1904.<lb/>Ratified
                        by the President, March 17, 1904.<lb/>King of Ethiopia notified of
                        ratification, August 2, 1904.<lb/>Proclaimed, September 30, 1904.</hi></p>

